{"id": "EUVD-2026-96906", "enisaUuid": "cba25f2c-cd1b-376e-bbae-ef92677d9054", "description": "GoatCounter through 2.7.0 contains a mass assignment privilege escalation vulnerability in the userPrefSave handler that allows logged-in users to modify protected account fields via form-encoded requests. Attackers with read-only access can POST user.access[all]=* and user.email_verified=true to /user/pref, bypassing readonly tags to gain superuser or admin access.", "datePublished": "2026-10-11T12:19:44", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T13:28:05", "baseScore": 7.2, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haind03/goatcounter-user-pref-access-mass-assignment-20261011", "https://github.com/arp242/goatcounter/blob/7e91d8a9bdbb0dd48496e498c5680f8f3477a1b4/handlers/settings_user.go#L33-L99", "https://github.com/arp242/goatcounter/blob/7e91d8a9bdbb0dd48496e498c5680f8f3477a1b4/user.go#L191-L218", "https://github.com/arp242/goatcounter", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/goatcounter-through-2.7.0-privilege-escalation-via-user-pref-mass-assignment"], "aliases": ["GHSA-4f43-5hgr-4m7r", "CVE-2026-108740"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.33, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "3a569b65-2abb-3460-bb38-047cfc54f0ed", "product": {"name": "GoatCounter", "vendor": {"name": "arp242"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22642.7.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "36a4834d-e080-37f7-8687-8475f100d049", "vendor": {"name": "arp242"}}], "isExploited": false}